recover ChildVault CCIP send on Arbitrum fork
├── when the Arbitrum child epoch withdraw CCIP send fails
│   ├── it should emit CcipSendRecoveryStored
│   ├── it should retry the send and route USDC to Base
│   └── it should make the parent epoch claimable for USDC
└── when the Arbitrum child rebalance CCIP send fails
    ├── it should emit CcipSendRecoveryStored
    ├── it should retry the send and route USDC to Base
    └── it should clear the Arbitrum active adapter and finalize the parent rebalance
